                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fac9e33d-2d63-3f22-af13-3b6fd05a75f8",
                        "entry_id": "2a8115ad-86ba-3b25-8998-196013e4f499",
                        "glosses": [
                            "iets wat heel ordinair en plat is"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9898b04c-1d4d-4d30-9bc6-c4901067d5c4",
                                "sense_id": "fac9e33d-2d63-3f22-af13-3b6fd05a75f8",
                                "text": "Op zijn Facebookpagina verklaart Romney waarom Ted Cruz zijn stem krijgt. Dat blijkt vooral een anti-Trumpstem te zijn, een stem tegen wat de voormalig kandidaat Trumpisme noemt. Hij schrijft dat dat gelijk staat aan 'racisme, misogynie, kwezelarij, xenofobie, vulgariteit en, sinds kort, bedreigingen en geweld. Ik walg van al deze dingen.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4f23500-5a8e-46df-a9b4-c75ea9d27a6f",
                                "sense_id": "fac9e33d-2d63-3f22-af13-3b6fd05a75f8",
                                "text": "De school toonde zich maandag teleurgesteld over de beslissing. Zij kan nu naar eigen zeggen niet meer ervoor zorgen dat leerlingen naar school kunnen gaan in 'omgeving vrij van seksuele inhoud en vulgariteit'. De meisjes zijn blij dat hun recht is onderstreept om voor een goede zaak op te komen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f4cb387-bb6b-4add-9257-aa9dc6ed4124",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a8115ad-86ba-3b25-8998-196013e4f499",
                        "source_sense_id": "fac9e33d-2d63-3f22-af13-3b6fd05a75f8",
                        "target_lang_word": "crudeness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "crudeness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f611eff-2f56-3bff-8381-e6cee5ef19ec",
                                        "entry_id": "3543b5ca-0aea-38ff-8d15-25985eaa1c49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being crude"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc7e9d10-5aff-3fdd-b721-b0c7e5e03789",
                                        "entry_id": "3543b5ca-0aea-38ff-8d15-25985eaa1c49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A crude act or characteristic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78a7be69-643f-4481-b9c6-b359e3e6cbb2",
                                                "sense_id": "cc7e9d10-5aff-3fdd-b721-b0c7e5e03789",
                                                "text": "We will never eliminate the crudenesses, the anti-intellectual rules, the mucker pose in higher education, until we give the universities back to faculty and students."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b5002276-2beb-4aef-9e3d-bcc207c79674",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a8115ad-86ba-3b25-8998-196013e4f499",
                        "source_sense_id": "fac9e33d-2d63-3f22-af13-3b6fd05a75f8",
                        "target_lang_word": "coarseness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coarseness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b635064-a2bc-3af3-98b2-a1dd3930dbaa",
                                        "entry_id": "ecbe3876-107f-3c7d-bf5a-8746e5f50786",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The property of being coarse, roughness or primitiveness, unrefined or unpolished."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8cd7a140-ff9b-37e7-ace3-725e2738cabe",
                                        "entry_id": "ecbe3876-107f-3c7d-bf5a-8746e5f50786",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being coarse"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2683bf7e-5926-4b59-9b76-6886a0916094",
                                                "sense_id": "8cd7a140-ff9b-37e7-ace3-725e2738cabe",
                                                "text": "coarseness of food, texture, manners, or language"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "607560e7-4a2f-4d19-a19f-34a99a5a49a8",
                                                "sense_id": "8cd7a140-ff9b-37e7-ace3-725e2738cabe",
                                                "text": "All this was extraordinarily distasteful to Churchill. It was ugly, gross. […] Never before had he felt such repulsion when the vicar displayed his characteristic bluntness or coarseness of speech. In the present connection—[…]—such talk had been distressingly out of place."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cebaa570-c460-392b-ae1e-af8b655a8e0c",
                                        "entry_id": "ecbe3876-107f-3c7d-bf5a-8746e5f50786",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is coarse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3dc2a75-9d87-4a48-a0c3-02a3e6c81d62",
                                                "sense_id": "cebaa570-c460-392b-ae1e-af8b655a8e0c",
                                                "text": "This sketch is rather coarse, but probably it is as little exaggerated as could be expected from Walpole. The society which it illustrates abounded with such coarsenesses. Princesses were not expected to exhibit much propriety—nor Duchesses to be overburthened with delicacy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c877d666-0ca6-4749-84cb-b0a6cb5a7699",
                                                "sense_id": "cebaa570-c460-392b-ae1e-af8b655a8e0c",
                                                "text": "Hogarth does not refrain from introducing a sign in his engraving “Noon,” of 1738, showing the Baptist’s head on a charger, with the cynical inscription “Good Eating.” Whether such coarsenesses were actually perpetrated, even under the lax régime of Charles II in England, when frivolity reigned after the fall of Cromwell, it is hard to decide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a33131a-fcc4-432d-9f6c-cddeb82c5714",
                                                "sense_id": "cebaa570-c460-392b-ae1e-af8b655a8e0c",
                                                "text": "In fact, Angela Lansbury’s bawdy, chattering, equivocal Granny—a super opportunity glintily grasped—is as likely to entertain young Rosaleen with such coarsenesses as ‘. . . and she found another husband not too shy to piss into a pot’ as to scare her with warnings about men whose eyebrows meet: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d80d33b7-3398-4310-af61-df673a348304",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a8115ad-86ba-3b25-8998-196013e4f499",
                        "source_sense_id": "fac9e33d-2d63-3f22-af13-3b6fd05a75f8",
